        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "\"Having served the kingdom for ten thousand years and another one thousand years, i.e. for a total of eleven thousand years, Rama will go to the abode of Brahma... [1-1-97]"
